step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Head to the <col=800000>Icyene Graveyard</col>, accessed via the boat in either southern <col=800000>Burgh de Rott</col>, <col=800000>Meiyerditch</col>, or <col=800000>Slepe</col>. Players can also use the Drakan's medallion teleport to Ver Sinhaza, exit into Meiyerditch, then run to the boat in the south-western corner of the area.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Head to the Icyene Graveyard, accessed via the boat in either southern Burgh de Rott, Meiyerditch, or Slepe. Players can also use the Drakan's medallion teleport to Ver Sinhaza, exit into Meiyerditch, then run to the boat in the south-western corner of the area.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Speak to <col=800000>Sarius Guile</col>.</col>
