line	<str>Search the north-west shelves and take one of each potion: cloudy grey, weightless black, thick red, and cold bluish-white.</str>
line	
line	<str>Based on the inscriptions on the basin, place the potions in the following basins:</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the altar for an ancient symbol.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the east door, then pull the lever in the north-west corner.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the portal, then go through the south door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the east, east, south-east, then north doors.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the crate by the window for an ancient shield.</str>
line	
line	<str>Combine the shield and symbol to create the shield with symbol.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go through the south, west, and north doors, then head upstairs.</col>
step	110	-	Quick guide step 110
line	<str>Head to the Icyene Graveyard, accessed via the boat in either southern Burgh de Rott, Meiyerditch, or Slepe. Players can also use the Drakan's medallion teleport to Ver Sinhaza, exit into Meiyerditch, then run to the boat in the south-western corner of the area.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Sarius Guile.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the hideout under Old Man Ral's house in Meiyerditch Via the Trap Door Located In the House. (type=maplink|x=3607|y=3208|mtype=pin)</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the nearby chest to obtain a vyre noble outfit if you forgot to bring it.</str>
line	
line	<str>Wear the vyre noble outfit, then inspect the makeshift shrine for a cutscene.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Ivan Strom.</str>
line	
line	<str>Prepare for a fight. The fight is a battle of endurance, you are required to protect yourself and Ivan from multiple vyrewatch and vyrewatch sentinels for several minutes.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Ivan afterwards, and he'll tell you to meet up at the church in Slepe.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to Slepe, either via Drakan's medallion teleport to Slepe, or if that is not unlocked, teleport to Ver Sinhaza and run north to Slepe.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Ivan Strom in Slepe, just west of the church.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go into the Slepe pub and ask the bartender Roy about a friend.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the Sisterhood Sanctuary through the stairs south of the church's graveyard.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head north until reaching Kroy's laboratory, then climb the ladder to enter Crombwick Manor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Help Veliaf Hurtz kill the five vyrewatches.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Veliaf.</str>
line	
line	<str>Make your way to Drezel in Paterdomus Temple, which can be quickly reached via fairy ring (CKS).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Ivan, read the squire's journal, then talk to Ivan again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head west through the mausoleum and up to the temple, then kill all the monks of Zamorak.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head upstairs and talk to Ivan.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search through the bookcases for six books. Place them books on the plinths in the following order (from north to south):</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Ivan to obtain Ivandis' writings, then read it.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk with him again to return to the mausoleum.</str>
line	
line	<str>Stock up on supplies for a fight with multiple vyrewatches and sentinels.</str>
line	
line	<str>When ready, return to Paterdomus and talk to Ivan or Veliaf.</str>
line	
line	<str>Mine away the blockage immediately south of Ivan. If you do not have a pickaxe, talk to Ivan for a bronze pickaxe.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the blockage and head north-east through the tunnel.</str>
line	
line	<str>There will be a few vyrewatches and vyrewatch sentinels to defeat inside. Focus on the sentinels first while praying protect from magic. They will occasionally spawn a blood orb that will do passive damage.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Ivan.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head north through the entry.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head north-west and climb up either of the stairs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head east and pray to the shrine to unlock a teleport back here with Drakan's medallion.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the portal at the centre of the room.</str>
line	
line	<str>With (A) as the starting point on the map, Pick up and read the poem scroll on the table just south (B).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the east door and then search the throne (C), which will reveal four levers in the busts to the east.</str>
line	
line	<str>From north to south, pull the 3rd, 4th, 1st, and 2nd busts in that order</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the throne again for the half moon key.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the south door, then search the shelves (D) to the south-west to find the small clock hand.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the doors to the north, then west, to return to the dining room.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the west door using the half moon key to arrive in a corridor. Walk around the traps to avoid them.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the west door. Quickly search the crate for a tinderbox (E), then climb up the stairs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the explosive barrel (F), then enter the south door. Search the crate for a Drakan emblem (G), then exit the room.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the east door, then through the north door.</str>
line	
line	<str>From the uk=1 of the main entrance hall, go through either of the north doors.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the north unmarked door (not the crescent moon door), then head to the south door (next to empty receptacle) while avoiding traps.</str>
line	
line	<str>Place the Drakan emblem on the receptacle (H), then enter. Search the crate in the north-west corner for a large clock hand (I).</str>
line	
line	<str>Exit the room, then return through the western door while avoiding traps.</str>
line	
line	<str>To the east of the crescent moon door is a lever (J); pull it to open a portal.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the portal which will teleport you to (K), then use the south door, then the west door, to return to the dining room fireplace (L)</str>
line	
line	<str>Place the small hand on the western grandfather clock. Set the big hand to 11, and the small hand to 9.</str>
line	
line	<str>Place the large hand on the eastern grandfather clock. Set the big hand to 12, and the small hand to 4.</str>
line	
line	<str>Inspect the fireplace and select "search" to receive a second Drakan emblem.</str>
line	
line	<str>From the chest room (A), go through the west door, then the south-westernmost door to enter a laboratory (B). Kill all the sanguidae.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the syringe barrel from the table.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the crate to the south-east for a venator stomach.</str>
line	
line	<str>Inspect the sink to the west, and remove the sink plug.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the north-west door (C). Use the sink plug on the sink, then turn the tap on when prompted.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the broken pipe from the sink. Use it on the nearby cabinet to receive a sharp knife.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the crate near the sink for the syringe plunger.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the laboratory (B) through the south door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the sharp knife on the venator corpse to receive a pair of tongs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the tongs on the sink for a syringe needle. Use one of the syringe parts on another to assemble an empty syringe.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the empty syringe on the venator stomach to receive a full syringe.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the full syringe on the chest to receive a left crest half.</str>
line	
line	<str>From the laboratory, exit through the north-east crescent moon door, then go through the nearest door to return to the main hall.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the stairs (D), then enter the first door on the south side (E). Deal with the venator; pray Protect from Melee or Missiles depending on distance, and turn it off when it is about to screech to avoid damage.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the weapons rack at the east end of the room.</str>
line	
line	<str>The statues must be mirrored on the north and south sides of the rooms. From east to west, they should be holding battleaxes, spears, maces, and swords.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the chest to receive a right crest half. Combine it with the left to create the full crest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Exit the basement through the north-west door, then up the stairs to the west, then from the portal room, go through the doors to the south-east, east, then north.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the full crest on the fireplace. Inspect the fireplace and select "search" to receive a new moon key.</str>
line	
line	<str>From the fireplace, return to the main hall by going through the south, west, then north doors.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the stairs to the basement, then enter the either of the doors on the north side (A) to initiate a cutscene where you free Safalaan and Vanescula.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pick up the gibbous moon key.</str>
line	
line	<str>Leave the jail room through either south door, climb up the stairs to the main hall, then climb up the stairs again to the uk=1.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the south-east door (the gibbous moon door).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the east, south, then south-east doors. Search the crate for an ornate knife (B).</str>
line	
line	<str>Pull the lever on the western wall. Enter the portal, teleporting to (C). Then go through the north door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the gibbous moon door on the eastern wall. Kill the venator to prevent being disrupted from solving the room puzzle or just run past it.</str>
line	
line	<str>Light the fireplace, then search the chest (D) just east for a lockbox.</str>
line	
line	<str>Open the lockbox with the code (from left to right): the ⠿, the ᴟ, and symbol that looks like ⁘, to get a fancy gem.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the south-west door (E) by inputting the passcode "SPEAR".</str>
line	
line	<str>One of the bookcases (F) will be searchable; do so for a mysterious book.</str>
line	
line	<str>Open the book for another fancy gem, then leave the room.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use both fancy gems on the mounted venator head to the east (G).</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the head for an ornate hourglass, then go through the west door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the ornate skull, hourglass, and knife on the display case to the west (H). The order does not matter.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the display case for a gilded key.</str>
line	
line	<str>From the display case, climb down the staircase, then through the north door - beware of Sanguidae, quickly go through the west door after entering.</str>
line	
line	<str>After this west door (the gilded door), go through the north-west door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill the venator in the room, then talk to Ivan.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the northern bookcase for a gilded book.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the south-eastern bookcase for a vampyre book.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the gilded book on the western gilded bookcase, then inspect the books when prompted.</str>
line	
line	<str>Rearrange the symbols of the Vampyric Houses in alphabetical order.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the secret passage to the south. Take the full moon key from the table.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the east door, then the east gilded door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the unmarked north door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the easternmost door, while avoiding the traps.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the stairs, then run west and enter the door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the east full moon door. Kill the webbed-winged crows if necessary.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the north-west shelves and take one of each potion: cloudy grey, weightless black, thick red, and cold bluish-white.</str>
line	
line	<str>Based on the inscriptions on the basin, place the potions in the following basins:</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the altar for an ancient symbol.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the east door, then pull the lever in the north-west corner.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the portal, then go through the south door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the east, east, south-east, then north doors.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the crate by the window for an ancient shield.</str>
line	
line	<str>Combine the shield and symbol to create the shield with symbol.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the south, west, and north doors, then head upstairs.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go through the south-east (the southern door on the eastern wall) gibbous moon door, then through the south-east full moon door.</col>
